<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Standex cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standex cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Wednesday it had reduced its rating for Standex International Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Salem, N.H., diversified manufacturer opened up 1/8 to 29-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
